### Database Cleanup

#### [cleanup-databases.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/cleanup-databases.js)

Created cleanup script that:
- Deletes [ghg.db](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/ghg.db) (if not locked)
- Deletes [users.json](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/users.json), [emissions.json](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/emissions.json), [emissions_audit.json](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/emissions_audit.json)
- Searches for and deletes all `user_*.db` files
- Provides clear console output of cleanup progress

**Execution Result:**
- ✅ Deleted: [users.json](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/users.json)
- ✅ Deleted: [emissions.json](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/emissions.json)
- ✅ Deleted: [emissions_audit.json](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/emissions_audit.json)
- ❌ [ghg.db](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/ghg.db) was locked (user had it open in editor)

> [!NOTE]
> The [ghg.db](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/ghg.db) file should be manually deleted or the cleanup script re-run after closing the file in the editor.

